<p>Yes. Presumably the containment procedures for Keter class anomalies (as well as the actions of other GOI invested in not dying; notably the GOC) actually <em>do</em> something.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Something like this would spread at a exponential rate, not a geometric one.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Not everyone was susceptible, and therefore immune populations and natural countermemes were initially rate limiting. If you'll notice, it quickly goes exponential later.</p>

